{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-ffmpeg#feature-probe-zh","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg","commit":"f531a0c2d083126b0019fc8c9a6dcb6df171ad46","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-ffmpeg** 的功能「媒体探测」：读取本地媒体的容器、时长、大小、码率及视频、音频和字幕流信息。调用 ffmpeg_probe 并提供 input 路径，结果以摘要和结构化字段返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:235-265"]}
